            "sid": "1KI 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usho kanje uJehova, uthi: Aniyikukhuphuka nilwe nabafowenu, abantwana bakwa-Israyeli; buyelani, kube yilowo nalowo endlini yakhe; ngoba lokhu kungokwami. Balilalela izwi likaJehova, babuyela emuva ukuba bahambe njengezwi likaJehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
