          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yasicebisana, yenza amathole amabili egolide, yathi kubo: “Kungaphezu kwamandla enu ukukhuphukela eJerusalema; bheka, Israyeli, onkulunkulu bakho abakukhipha ezweni laseGibithe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
