          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanikela ngomhlatshelo e-altare alenzayo eBethele ngosuku lweshumi nanhlanu lwenyanga yesishiyagalombili, ngenyanga abeyicabangile kweyakhe inhliziyo; walungisela abantwana bakwa-Israyeli idili, walibeka e-altare, wanyusa impepho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.33",
